WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:02.633
Eleven forty-seven p.m.

00:00:02.633 --> 00:00:04.320
A cart sits open.

00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:05.313
Two items.

00:00:05.313 --> 00:00:08.588
A cursor, hovering over checkout.

00:00:09.288 --> 00:00:10.377
And then...

00:00:10.377 --> 00:00:11.170
nothing.

00:00:11.170 --> 00:00:12.656
The tab closes.

00:00:12.656 --> 00:00:14.538
The cart goes cold.

00:00:15.238 --> 00:00:17.965
Usually, that's where the story ends.

00:00:17.965 --> 00:00:19.292
They meant to buy.

00:00:19.292 --> 00:00:21.134
They just got distracted.

00:00:21.134 --> 00:00:24.304
And that sale walks out the door with them.

00:00:25.004 --> 00:00:26.963
But what if it didn't end there?

00:00:26.963 --> 00:00:30.270
Recatch can also handle abandoned cart, and follow-up.

00:00:30.970 --> 00:00:32.100
Tag the contact.

00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:34.715
Set a field for what's in their cart.

00:00:34.715 --> 00:00:37.682
And a follow-up sequence starts the clock.

00:00:38.382 --> 00:00:41.782
Hours later, or days later, a timely,

00:00:41.782 --> 00:00:45.826
friendly reminder lands right in their chat.

00:00:45.826 --> 00:00:46.653
Telegram.

00:00:46.653 --> 00:00:47.572
Instagram.

00:00:47.572 --> 00:00:48.491
Messenger.

00:00:48.491 --> 00:00:49.319
WhatsApp.

00:00:50.018 --> 00:00:53.406
And the moment they reply, the sequence stops.

00:00:53.406 --> 00:00:54.216
No pile-on.

00:00:54.216 --> 00:00:58.856
Just a conversation, and you can step in from the shared inbox.

00:00:59.556 --> 00:01:00.818
They come back.

00:01:00.818 --> 00:01:02.501
The order completes.

00:01:02.501 --> 00:01:04.773
The sale you almost lost...

00:01:04.773 --> 00:01:05.362
caught.

00:01:06.062 --> 00:01:08.317
Don't let another cart go cold.

00:01:08.317 --> 00:01:11.301
Build your follow-up sequence in minutes.

00:01:11.301 --> 00:01:13.266
Get started at recatch.app.
